    {
      "article_type": "news",
      "title": "国际清算银行：前沿AI与网络风险，攻击成本已降至可操作区间",
      "author": "KC桌面",
      "digest": "前沿AI与网络风险，攻击成本已降至可操作区间，非国家行为体门槛大幅降低。",
      "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">攻击成本已降至可操作区间，非国家行为体门槛大幅降低</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">2026</span>年4月7日，Anthropic发布Mythos模型，它不仅能识别软件漏洞，还能自主开发利用代码、执行多步骤网络攻击。几周后，OpenAI的GPT-5.5在专家级网络攻防测试中达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">71.4%</span>的通过率，超过Mythos的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;\">68.6%</span>。国际清算银行（BIS）在最新简报中提出一个关键问题：这是否意味着资金基础设施的网络安全假设需要根本性重估？</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXyb7fkZk21kUMFHZwOteNITUvMkStFj1tvzY5DPhsHzTbw0cNxwP8UicviaGl5k6s5jKofhG2eViahK1xSyshT55lZpALuY3Ve5c/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_002]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px;\">银行、支付系统和市场基础设施是宏观环境中攻击密度最高、互联最紧密的部分，它们依赖复杂的专有和开源软件链条以及第三方供应商。攻击者能力的阶跃式提升，其影响可能超出单一机构，直接触及宏观环境稳定。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOW2ZxtFaScjrcVBf81N4H7ZLh52TFbvSVVASqGShExl4icavp13Ydk3PkooZzZ9sBfScIAticzm4CLQib7HYnZmwZkk4GPsVJnoew/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_003]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVUbqDNFAlItEia35AAiaXV27UicmM4gHceh8rSHFOqlmTibk4rjrC6HNvrCV8bUqIhPn8icMzuB6xiaZag7SzNsrZqyiaPP1bEib17b5M/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_001]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWls8BiaR6FJBmiatJh4uLgGdOuicLrV002ywzMKwwSFpiaqUeq4nLDKz0tiaS5OgpYFBx8o4fXDHAjiaF3EobHIiafmL2WdWtCCFRY6Y/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left;\">Original report: BIS A-Mythos-moment-Frontier-AI-and-cyber-risk e87055dd</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600;\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
      "thumb_media_id": "avPwUQVH0p7DPpCFFkit8-mXHhDnMmqjHf2Tt4iZ63jJe11Ygu3LYln_LUoRa1zO",
      "need_open_comment": 0,
